      538.02
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, hereby declare, under Subsection (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
